<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia steady at 1.8580 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia steady at 1.8580 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia was unchanged at 1.8580 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange on Wednesday.</p>
<p>					  June 11	    June 10</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar		1.8580	     1.8580</p>
<p> Volume traded			$35.14 million	 $25.23 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380-44-244-9150</p>
</text>
